                                                                                
  ! bd 1.2.1 is not supported                                                   
                                                                                
  bd 1.2.0 and 1.2.1 were withdrawn releases; 1.2.2 re-released the tested      
  line. bdash does not run on them.                                             
                                                                                
  + bd           /usr/bin/bd                                                    
  x version      1.2.1 - withdrawn release, needs 1.2.2+                        
  - JSON schema  not run                                                        
  - workspace    not run                                                        
  - snapshot     not run                                                        
                                                                                
  What to do                                                                    
  > $ go install github.com/gastownhall/beads/cmd/bd@latest                     
      # your bd was built with Go                                               
    $ brew upgrade beads                                                        
      # or with Homebrew                                                        
    Upgrading bd does not touch your issues.                                    
                                                                                
  same report: bdash -v                                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
  q quit  r recheck now  Up/Dn pick  y copy fix                                 